file: pages/pageimu.ui
suite: ui
tier: gl
test: glPagesRender
why: PageImu embeds a Vesc3DView and cannot be built without an OpenGL
     context, so only the GL tier can catch this. It is here to prove that
     tier actually runs -- it skipped silently for the whole life of this
     suite, because nothing in the dev shell provided xvfb-run and a skip is
     easy to read past. A tab label rather than a widget name, because
     renaming a widget breaks the generated ui_ header and the mutation would
     only prove the compiler works
--- from
       <string>Accel/Gyro/Mag</string>
--- to
       <string>Accel/Gyro/Magnetometer</string>
